<title>SWEDEN: MARIEBERG SELLS HALF OF DUNI TO SEP.</title>
<headline>MARIEBERG SELLS HALF OF DUNI TO SEP.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish media group Tidnings AB Marieberg said on Thursday it signed an agreement with Scandinavian Equity Partners Limited (SEP) for SEP to become half-owner of disposable tableware maker Duni AB.</p>
<p>At present Duni is a wholly owned subsidiary of Marieberg.</p>
</text>
